      "extractedText": "Bid opening shall be on October 17, 2018 at 10:00 a.m. at the Conference Room of the\nMunicipal Building, Miagao, Iloilo. Bids will be opened in the presence of the Bidders'\nrepresentatives who choose to attend at the address below. Late bids shall not be\naccepted.\nConference Room\nMunicipal Building, Mueda St.\nMiagao, Iloilo\n8.\nThe Municipality of Miagao reserves the right to accept or reject any bid and all bids,\ndeclare failure of bidding, or not to award the contract in accordance with Section\n41 of RA 9184 and its IRR, without thereby incurring any liability to the affected\nbidder or bidders.\n9.\nFor further information, please refer to:\nSHERWIN KEITH M. FAINA\nMunicipal Planning and Development Office\nLocal Government Unit of Miagao\nMueda St,\n5023 Miagao, Iloilo\nTelefax No.: (033) 315-8050 loc. 101\nWebsite: www.miagao.gov.ph\nEmail: lgumiagao@yahoo.com\nSHERWIN KEITH M. FAINA\nBAC Chairperson\n3",
